==Introduction==

===Abstract===

This document specifies NestedMuSig2, a recursive variant of [https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/master/bip-0327.mediawiki BIP327] MuSig2 based on the construction introduced by [[https://eprint.iacr.org/2026/223|Nested MuSig2]]. NestedMuSig2 permits a participant at a MuSig2 aggregation node to be represented by the aggregate public key of another MuSig2 signing group, thereby forming a tree of nested signing groups.

The leaf signers in the tree cooperate to produce a single [https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/master/bip-0340.mediawiki BIP340]-compatible Schnorr signature under the root aggregate public key. The final signature uses the ordinary 64-byte BIP340 signature encoding and is verified using the ordinary 32-byte BIP340 x-only public-key encoding. Verification requires no knowledge of the internal nesting structure or the leaf signer set.

